From: Basin Battle <basin@battle>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 17:56:43 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Action-combat mouse and aiming camera for Elwynn Survival

SetActionMouse(on): the left button is the add-on's (its BUTTON1 binding), never the camera's;
the middle button orbits and selects in its place; left+right still runs, except while aiming.
SetAimCamera(on[, back, right, up]): ease the camera in over the right shoulder, steadier look.
HasActionCombat(): 1 on a client with these.
